Package: cleaningkitapp
Title: Point-and-Click Interface for 4Mi Data Cleaning with cleaningkit
Version: 2026.11.0
Authors@R:
    person("Abubakar", "Athman", , "abubakar.athman@mixedmigration.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application over the cleaningkit package. It walks a
    data officer through a 4Mi validation round - project folders, the
    XLSForm, the raw export - without editing the example scripts, and keeps
    every setting in a project profile so the next round starts where the
    last one ended.
